<Folder><name>🏖️ Spiagge</name>
<Placemark>
  <name>Plage de l&#x27;Écluse</name>
  <description><![CDATA[<p>[🏖️ Spiagge] Spiaggia-icona di Dinard: tende a strisce, casinò, belvedere. La più vivace.</p><p><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=48.6364681%2C-2.0553620">Apri in Google Maps</a></p>]]></description>
  <styleUrl>#s1</styleUrl>
  <Point><coordinates>-2.0553620,48.6364681,0</coordinates></Point>
</Placemark>
<Placemark>
  <name>Plage du Prieuré</name>
  <description><![CDATA[<p>[🏖️ Spiagge] Famiglie, parco Port-Breton, piscina d&#x27;acqua di mare a marea bassa. Vista Saint-Malo.</p><p><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=48.6256661%2C-2.0532040">Apri in Google Maps</a></p>]]></description>
  <styleUrl>#s1</styleUrl>
  <Point><coordinates>-2.0532040,48.6256661,0</coordinates></Point>
</Placemark>
<Placemark>
  <name>Plage de Saint-Énogat</name>
  <description><![CDATA[<p>[🏖️ Spiagge] Più intima, rock pools, atmosfera da villaggio. Quartiere originario di Dinard.</p><p><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=48.6391009%2C-2.0693179">Apri in Google Maps</a></p>]]></description>
  <styleUrl>#s1</styleUrl>
  <Point><coordinates>-2.0693179,48.6391009,0</coordinates></Point>
</Placemark>
<Placemark>
  <name>Plage de Port-Blanc</name>
  <description><![CDATA[<p>[🏖️ Spiagge] La più selvaggia delle 4 di Dinard. Confine con Saint-Lunaire.</p><p><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=48.6365263%2C-2.0816410">Apri in Google Maps</a></p>]]></description>
  <styleUrl>#s1</styleUrl>
  <Point><coordinates>-2.0816410,48.6365263,0</coordinates></Point>
</Placemark>
<Placemark>
  <name>Grande Plage de Saint-Lunaire</name>
  <description><![CDATA[<p>[🏖️ Spiagge] ~10 min da Dinard. Ampia spiaggia di sabbia.</p><p><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=48.6377817%2C-2.1099974">Apri in Google Maps</a></p>]]></description>
  <styleUrl>#s1</styleUrl>
  <Point><coordinates>-2.1099974,48.6377817,0</coordinates></Point>
</Placemark>
<Placemark>
  <name>Île de Cézembre</name>
  <description><![CDATA[<p>[🏖️ Spiagge] Solo in battello da Dinard/St-Malo (~20 min). Spiaggia a sud. Parte nord interdetta (WWII).</p><p><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=48.6768428%2C-2.0715022">Apri in Google Maps</a></p>]]></description>
  <styleUrl>#s1</styleUrl>
  <Point><coordinates>-2.0715022,48.6768428,0</coordinates></Point>
</Placemark>
</Folder>
<Folder><name>Nudist Naturiste</name>
<Placemark>
  <name>Fourberie — zona naturista (Saint-Lunaire)</name>
  <description><![CDATA[<p>[Nudist Naturiste] Naturismo TOLLERATO nella caletta a OVEST dopo le rocce. Non ufficiale. Cani vietati.</p><p><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=48.6352882%2C-2.0850938">Apri in Google Maps</a></p>]]></description>
  <styleUrl>#s2</styleUrl>
  <Point><coordinates>-2.0850938,48.6352882,0</coordinates></Point>
</Placemark>
<Placemark>
  <name>Chevrets — zona naturista (Saint-Coulomb)</name>
  <description><![CDATA[<p>[Nudist Naturiste] Naturismo lato est verso Pointe du Meinga. Grande spiaggia. ~25–30 min auto da Dinard.</p><p><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=48.6926072%2C-1.9418849">Apri in Google Maps</a></p>]]></description>
  <styleUrl>#s2</styleUrl>
  <Point><coordinates>-1.9418849,48.6926072,0</coordinates></Point>
</Placemark>
</Folder>
<Folder><name>🛒 Mercati</name>
<Placemark>
  <name>Halles &amp; Marché Dinard (Place Crolard)</name>
  <description><![CDATA[<p>[🛒 Mercati] Halles coperte: ogni mattina 7:30–13:30. Mercato esterno mar/gio/sab: set–giu 9–12:30 (sab→13); lug–ago 8:30–14. Fino a ~300 banchi in estate.</p><p><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=48.6320459%2C-2.0580392">Apri in Google Maps</a></p>]]></description>
  <styleUrl>#s3</styleUrl>
  <Point><coordinates>-2.0580392,48.6320459,0</coordinates></Point>
</Placemark>
<Placemark>
  <name>Marché Saint-Énogat (Place du Calvaire)</name>
  <description><![CDATA[<p>[🛒 Mercati] Solo luglio–agosto: mercoledì 9:00–12:30, Rue de Saint-Lunaire / Place du Calvaire.</p><p><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=48.6360000%2C-2.0679661">Apri in Google Maps</a></p>]]></description>
  <styleUrl>#s3</styleUrl>
  <Point><coordinates>-2.0679661,48.6360000,0</coordinates></Point>
</Placemark>
<Placemark>
  <name>Marché aux Huîtres Cancale</name>
  <description><![CDATA[<p>[🛒 Mercati] MUST ostriche. Port de la Houle, Rue des Parcs. 8 produttori, tutti i giorni (~9–17:30+). Degustazione sul posto, vista Mont-Saint-Michel.</p><p><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=48.6707685%2C-1.8513142">Apri in Google Maps</a></p>]]></description>
  <styleUrl>#s3</styleUrl>
  <Point><coordinates>-1.8513142,48.6707685,0</coordinates></Point>
</Placemark>
</Folder>
<Folder><name>⭐ Ristoranti</name>
<Placemark>
  <name>Pourquoi Pas ★ (Castelbrac)</name>
  <description><![CDATA[<p>[⭐ Ristoranti] 1 stella Michelin, chef Julien Hennote. Cucina moderna locale, vista mare. Prenotare. €€€€</p><p><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=48.6344466%2C-2.0490168">Apri in Google Maps</a></p>]]></description>
  <styleUrl>#s4</styleUrl>
  <Point><coordinates>-2.0490168,48.6344466,0</coordinates></Point>
</Placemark>
<Placemark>
  <name>Didier Méril</name>
  <description><![CDATA[<p>[⭐ Ristoranti] 1 Place du Général de Gaulle. Vista baia del Prieuré. Pesce e cucina di mercato. €€€</p><p><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=48.6274381%2C-2.0555345">Apri in Google Maps</a></p>]]></description>
  <styleUrl>#s4</styleUrl>
  <Point><coordinates>-2.0555345,48.6274381,0</coordinates></Point>
</Placemark>
<Placemark>
  <name>La Passerelle du Clair de Lune</name>
  <description><![CDATA[<p>[⭐ Ristoranti] 3 Avenue George V. Vista cale, pesce. Top Tripadvisor Dinard.</p><p><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=48.6318335%2C-2.0520607">Apri in Google Maps</a></p>]]></description>
  <styleUrl>#s4</styleUrl>
  <Point><coordinates>-2.0520607,48.6318335,0</coordinates></Point>
</Placemark>
<Placemark>
  <name>La Vallée</name>
  <description><![CDATA[<p>[⭐ Ristoranti] 6 Avenue George V. Sullo scoglio sopra la cale del Bec de la Vallée. Cucina iodata. €€</p><p><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=48.6362639%2C-2.0484626">Apri in Google Maps</a></p>]]></description>
  <styleUrl>#s4</styleUrl>
  <Point><coordinates>-2.0484626,48.6362639,0</coordinates></Point>
</Placemark>
<Placemark>
  <name>Café de la Plage (Saint-Énogat)</name>
  <description><![CDATA[<p>[⭐ Ristoranti] 66 Boulevard Albert Lacroix. Sul mare a Énogat, atmosfera rilassata.</p><p><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=48.6364062%2C-2.0678126">Apri in Google Maps</a></p>]]></description>
  <styleUrl>#s4</styleUrl>
  <Point><coordinates>-2.0678126,48.6364062,0</coordinates></Point>
</Placemark>
<Placemark>
  <name>Lou à la plage</name>
  <description><![CDATA[<p>[⭐ Ristoranti] Esplanade Jacques Chirac / ingresso diga Écluse. Fronte mare, aperto anche bar/tapas.</p><p><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=48.6353790%2C-2.0551035">Apri in Google Maps</a></p>]]></description>
  <styleUrl>#s4</styleUrl>
  <Point><coordinates>-2.0551035,48.6353790,0</coordinates></Point>
</Placemark>
</Folder>
