</Placemark>
<Placemark>
  <name>Boulevard Féart (shopping)</name>
  <description><![CDATA[<p>[🏛️ Centro] Asse shopping storico di Dinard. Boutique, moda, artigianato.</p><p><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=48.6325000%2C-2.0550000">Apri in Google Maps</a></p>]]></description>
